markdown <<MARKDOWN
# Rethinking Academic Integrity

#### AI tools are changing how students complete work, but they don’t eliminate the need for academic integrity. Instead, they shift what integrity looks like in the classroom.

#### Using AI is not automatically cheating. What matters is:
* #### How the tool is used
* #### Whether it supports learning
* #### Whether expectations are clear and consistent

#### Rather than focusing only on whether students used AI, the key question becomes: Did students do the thinking?

## AI Use Exists on a Spectrum

<div style="max-width:1100px; margin:0 auto; font-family:ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, Helvetica, Arial; color:#292F36;">
<!-- Labels Row -->
<div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; font-weight:800; font-size:18px; margin-bottom:10px;">
<div style="color:#E66A6A;">Not Allowed</div>
<div style="color:#58B77B;">Productive Use</div>
<div style="color:#F1B44C;">Over-Reliance</div>
</div>

<!-- Spectrum Line -->
<div style="position:relative; height:8px; background:linear-gradient(to right, #E66A6A, #F1B44C, #58B77B); border-radius:999px; margin-bottom:40px;">
</div>

<!-- Cards -->
<div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3, 1fr); gap:18px;">

<!-- Not Allowed -->
<div style="border:1px solid #E8ECF0; border-radius:16px; padding:20px; background:#FFF5F5;">
<div style="font-weight:800; font-size:18px; margin-bottom:8px;">Not Allowed</div>
<div style="font-size:16px; margin-bottom:8px;">Replaces student thinking</div>
<div style="font-size:15px; line-height:1.4; color:#555;">
Submitting AI-generated answers as final work
</div>
</div>

<!-- Productive Use -->
<div style="border:1px solid #E8ECF0; border-radius:16px; padding:20px; background:#F3FBF6;">
<div style="font-weight:800; font-size:18px; margin-bottom:8px;">Productive Use</div>
<div style="font-size:16px; margin-bottom:8px;">AI supports learning</div>
<div style="font-size:15px; line-height:1.4; color:#555;">
Using AI to brainstorm, revise, or get feedback
</div>
</div>

<!-- Over-Reliance -->
<div style="border:1px solid #E8ECF0; border-radius:16px; padding:20px; background:#FFF9F2;">
<div style="font-weight:800; font-size:18px; margin-bottom:8px;">Over-Reliance</div>
<div style="font-size:16px; margin-bottom:8px;">Student defers thinking to AI</div>
<div style="font-size:15px; line-height:1.4; color:#555;">
Copying and lightly editing AI output
</div>
</div>

</div>

</div>

####  Before assigning work, clarify:
* #### Is AI allowed?
* #### If yes, for what purpose?
* #### What must be original?

#### This clarity reduces confusion and prevents many integrity issues before they arise.

MARKDOWN
